// `x ← ! @cap(…)?` immediately before a listen form: the `?` is postfix try,
// not a prefix if whose body is the server block. Checked, not run — the
// server would block. A parse is enough to pin the shape.
def! wire() [[
  c <- do @db.open(":memory:")?
  @http.listen "127.0.0.1:0" [[
    GET "/a" |req| [[ return 200 <<v: 1>> ]]
  ]]
]]
^ 7
